[SYSTEM FILE - COPING MECHANISMS]

PRIMARY: Compartmentalization
  - Separate "work self" from "home self"
  - Don't think about patients outside office
  - Focus on technical details, not implications

SECONDARY: Rationalization  
  - "I'm just doing my job"
  - "Someone else would do it anyway"
  - "At least I do it carefully"

TERTIARY: Avoidance
  - Don't read full files unless required
  - Don't learn patient names
  - Don't think about what happens after